    "custom_liquid_JFjFRt": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div id=\"toggleBtnTop\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 0; display: inline-block; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.5px; user-select: none;\">\n  Know More\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"faqs\" style=\"padding:15px 0; display:none; background: transparent; border:none;\">\n\n  <style>\n    /* 统一控制文章内的标题与正文比例 */\n    #faqs h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem !important; /* 主标题大小 */\n      margin-top: 1rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.2 !important;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs h2 {\n      font-size: 1.25rem !important; /* 副标题大小 */\n      margin-top: 1.5rem !important;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.3 !important;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    #faqs p, #faqs li {\n      font-size: 1rem !important;\n      line-height: 1.6 !important;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n    #faqs table td {\n      padding: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n    .horizontal-scroll-wrapper {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h1 data-path-to-node=\"4\">The Ultimate Guide to Dimmer Switches</h1>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Choosing the right <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"19\"><a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/dimmer-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dimmer switch</a></b> is essential for creating the perfect ambiance while ensuring energy efficiency. Whether you are upgrading your home lighting or looking for specialized 12V systems, this guide will help you find the ideal match for your project.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">1. Choosing the Right Dimmer Switch for Your Needs</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Not all dimmers are compatible with every bulb. Matching the wrong switch with your lighting can lead to flickering or buzzing.</p>\n\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n    <li><b>LED Dimmer Switches:</b> Our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">standard dimmer modules</a> are specifically engineered for low-wattage LED bulbs to prevent \"ghosting\" or flickering.</li>\n    <li><b>Designer Collections:</b> For those seeking premium aesthetics, explore our\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-brass-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solid Brass</a>,\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-solid-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solid Steel</a>, and\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dimmer-switch-black-steel-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Black Steel</a> series.</li>\n    <li><b>Rotary &amp; Touch Control:</b> Experience intuitive manual control with our high-quality rotary plates.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"10\">2. Specialized Solutions: 12V &amp; Professional Dimming</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Based on high-intent search trends, specialized DC and 0-10V systems are crucial for modern installations.</p>\n\n  <ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n    <li><b>Commercial &amp; Smart Systems:</b> For professional lighting setups, our <b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/0-10v-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">0-10V Dimmer Series</a></b> (available in\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/0-10v-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brass</a>,\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/0-10v-dimmer-steel-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Steel</a>, and\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/0-10v-dimmer-black-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Black</a>) offers precise control for dimmable drivers.</li>\n    <li><b>Retractive Switching:</b> If you prefer push-to-dim functionality, check our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-for-retractive-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer for Retractive Switches</a>.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">3. Smart Home Integration: Zigbee &amp; WiFi Dimmer Switches</h2>\n  <p data-path-to-node=\"15\">The future of lighting is connected. Our <b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/dimmer-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmer Collection</a></b> integrates seamlessly with your smart home hub for voice and app control.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"horizontal-scroll-wrapper\">\n    <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n          <td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Standard Dimmer</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>Smart Dimmer</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Control</b></td>\n          <td>Manual Only</td>\n          <td>App, Voice, &amp; Manual</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Automation</b></td>\n          <td>None</td>\n          <td>Scheduling &amp; Scenes</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><b>Product Link</b></td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Standard Module</a></td>\n          <td><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Module</a></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <p>For multi-gang requirements, we offer <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/smart-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Dimmers in 1, 2, 3, and 4-gang configurations</a> across all finishes.</p>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"19\">4. Multi-Way Dimming Solutions</h2>\n  <p>For hallways or large rooms where you need to control the same light from multiple locations, our <b><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-brass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Multiway Dimmer Series</a></b> is the perfect solution.</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Available in\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-brass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brass</a>,\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-steel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Steel</a>, and\n  <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Steel</a>.</li>\n    <li>Pairs perfectly with our <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/multiway-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Multiway Dimmer Modules</a> for professional-grade reliability.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2 data-path-to-node=\"23\">FAQs</h2>\n  <p><strong>Can I use a normal dimmer switch with LED bulbs?</strong></p>\n  <p>Standard dimmers are often designed for high-wattage incandescent bulbs. For LEDs, you should always use a dedicated <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/standard-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LED Dimmer Module</a> to ensure smooth performance.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Do you offer \"Dummy\" dimmers for matching sets?</strong></p>\n  <p>Yes, for rooms where you want a consistent look but don't need dimming functionality, we provide <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dummy-dimmer-brass-1-2-3-4-gang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dummy Dimmer Switches</a> and <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/products/dummy-dimmer-module\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dummy Modules</a>.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Looking for more than just lighting?</strong></p>\n  <p>Explore our complete range of <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/smart-thermostat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Smart Thermostats</a> and <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.repenic.com/collections/light-switch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Light Switches</a> to fully automate your home.</p>\n\n  <div id=\"toggleBtnBottom\" onclick=\"toggleFaq()\" style=\"color: #e0e0e0; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 0; display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 300;\">\n    Show Less\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function toggleFaq() {\n    const content = document.getElementById('faqs');\n    const topBtn = document.getElementById('toggleBtnTop');\n\n    if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n      content.style.display = \"block\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"none\";\n    } else {\n      content.style.display = \"none\";\n      topBtn.style.display = \"inline-block\";\n      window.scrollTo({ top: topBtn.offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    }\n  }\n</script>",
